<title>USA: PacifiCorp, ABB venture seeks Minn. muni alliance.</title>
<headline>PacifiCorp, ABB venture seeks Minn. muni alliance.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, ORE. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>EnergyPact, a partnership between PacifiCorp and ABB Inc, announced Wednesday plans to form a marketing alliance with Southern Minnesota Municipal Power Agency (SMMPA) by next January.</p>
<p>Under the alliance, EnergyPact would assume responsibility for long-term marketing of SMMPA's power resources and would purchase and market power from other suppliers.</p>
<p>SMMPA provides electricity and services to 18 municipally-owned utilities in southern Minnesota.</p>
</text>
